  "Script": {
    "Data": {
      "Version": 0,
      "Text": "South Road's closed. Marion Road's at a standstill with a queue back about two kays. Anzac Highway and Cross Road are a bit slow, while Grenfell Road's got a queue of about a kay. Hancock Road and a couple more spots have short queues, and Mooringe Avenue's moving slowly. The South Eastern Freeway and North-South Motorway are moving nicely. It's clear on the Southern Expressway and Port Wakefield Road. Clear skies, nine degrees. Unleaded's cheapest at one sixty-three in Kilburn, with diesel there too at one ninety-four.",
      "EstimatedDurationSec": 0,
      "Sentences": [
        {
          "Text": "South Road's closed.",
          "CorridorKeys": ["South Road"]
        },
        {
          "Text": "Marion Road's at a standstill with a queue back about two kays.",
          "CorridorKeys": ["Marion Road"]
        },
        {
          "Text": "Anzac Highway and Cross Road are a bit slow, while Grenfell Road's got a queue of about a kay.",
