        },
        {
          "Text": "The South Eastern Freeway and North-South Motorway are moving nicely.",
          "CorridorKeys": []
        },
        {
          "Text": "It's clear on the Southern Expressway and Port Wakefield Road.",
          "CorridorKeys": []
        },
        {
          "Text": "Clear skies, nine degrees.",
          "CorridorKeys": []
